gent Zero (read prompt from /home/jlwestsr/projects/west_ai_labs/docs/career/agents/agent-zero.md). Fix any Weak/No Hire verdicts.\n\n## Step 5: Check Email\nUse gog CLI to check both jlwestsr@gmail.com and jason@westailabs.com for:\n- Recruiter responses, interview invites, application confirmations\n- Any calendar events related to interviews\nSummarize any findings.\n\n## Step 6: Deliver Summary\nWrite final summary to /home/jlwestsr/projects/west_ai_labs/docs/career/job-search-YYYY-MM-DD.md\n\nIMPORTANT: Today's date for filenames. Skip jobs already in previous search results files. Focus on NEW listings only.",
